I think this PR introduced a bug in convertToCoreMessages!

Specifically, when given assistant messages that have content and tool invocations, convertToCoreMessages now puts the tools before the content, when it used to put the tools after the content.

So this input:

```typescript
  const coreMessages = convertToCoreMessages([
    {
      role: "user",
      content: "request",
    },
    {
      role: "assistant",
      content: "response",
      toolInvocations: [
        {
          state: "result",
          step: 0,
          toolCallId: "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
          toolName: "toolName",
          args: {
            foo: "bar",
          },
          result: {
            other: "stuff",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
  ]);
```

Used to return:

```typescript
[
    {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "input asking for a tool"
    },
    {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "response"
    },
    {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "tool-call",
                "toolCallId": "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
                "toolName": "toolName",
                "args": {
                    "foo": "bar"
                }
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "role": "tool",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "tool-result",
                "toolCallId": "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
                "toolName": "toolName",
                "result": {
                    "other": "stuff"
                }
            }
        ]
    }
]
```

And now content comes before the tool calls:

```typescript
[
    {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "input asking for a tool"
    },
    {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "tool-call",
                "toolCallId": "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
                "toolName": "toolName",
                "args": {
                    "foo": "bar"
                }
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "role": "tool",
