Basically this came about because I was trying to implement a provider-agnostic version of the Anthropic `toolSearch` tool. My goal was to make a `toolSearch` tool that I could specify as the only tool, then inside of it's executor, have logic that queries our tool registry and does a search against them to return a list of valid tools.

